# Lowstreet (CIPlay lowstreet): the tram stop, the expedition plan, the cinema's projection box (wind turbine), the
# shops' air, the anglers, the electronics shop (advanced battery), the department store, the cage release refusing
# until the office's key, Ines's report, the lamp shop (advanced headlight), the big stingray, the diner.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Lowstreet
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Drowned District
zone tram_stop
expect step 1
read Expedition plan
expect step 2
read Council flood notice
expect step 3
zone shop_1
air shop_1
air shop_4
expect step 4
open Toy box at No. 14
wait 3
expect step 5
kill Angler fish
expect animals Angler fish 0
expect step 6
open Electronics shop
wait 3
expect step 7
open Diner
wait 3
expect step 8
read Jonah's letter
expect step 9
zone store_front
expect step 10
use cagerelease
expect story cagesopen 0
open Floor manager's office
wait 3
expect story storekey 1
use cagerelease
expect story cagesopen 1
expect step 11
read Ines's report
expect step 12
# STORY 10-24: Ines's chalk hooks along the street to the sewer mouth
zone ls_hook1
expect step 13
zone ls_hook2
expect step 14
open Projection box
wait 3
expect step 15
open Lamp shop
wait 3
expect step 16
kill Stingray
expect step 17
zone embankment
expect step 18
read Depot timetable
expect step 19
zone tram_wagons
expect step 20
open Stripped caravan's crate
wait 3
expect step 21
zone ls_hook3
expect step 22
read Ines's chalk note
expect done
